  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2503.01 Qualification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2503.01 Qualification. Pursuant to RSA 266:58-a, III-a, individuals may apply for a medical waiver of the after market tinting restriction set forth in Saf-C 2502.01 if they have a medical condition as listed in Saf-C 2503.02.\n\nSource. #4974, eff 11-13-90; ss by #6204, eff 3-15-96, EXPIRED: 3-15-04\n\nNew. #8072, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10083, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
